# TUI-DESIGN-4 §7.1: `/ui reset` clears every pane latch and answers `ui reset — <n> panes unlatched` (or
# `nothing was latched`). It is one of the four commands that take 37 → 41 this round, and it is the explicit
# unlatch the design chose INSTEAD of an auto-retry timer (A7 open question 1: a timer risks re-entering the
# render loop at 1/5 Hz). Driven with no fault, so the answer is the empty state.
expect \x1b\[\?25l
expect Say hi
sleep 0.4
send /ui reset
sleep 0.2
send \r
expect nothing was latched
sleep 0.3
send /exit
sleep 0.2
send \r
eof
